cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (preferred), or the software directly."
title: "HOA 360 Stream: containerised Higher-Order Ambisonics + 4K 360 livestream toolchain"
abstract: >-
  A freely-accessible, containerised toolchain for live streaming music events
  with Higher-Order Ambisonics audio (3rd order, 16 channels, ACN/SN3D) and 4K
  360 video over MPEG-DASH, rendered binaurally in the browser.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mróz"
    given-names: "Bartłomiej"
    email: "bartlomiej.mroz@pg.edu.pl"
    affiliation: "Department of Multimedia Systems, Gdańsk University of Technology"
repository-code: "https://git.pg.edu.pl/p829296/hoa-360-stream"
url: "https://bmroz.eu/projects/360-livestream/"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - "Higher-Order Ambisonics"
  - "spatial audio"
  - "360 video"
  - "MPEG-DASH"
  - "live streaming"
  - "binaural rendering"
